Chalke, 2 runs, played towards covers.", "Created_Timestamp": "2025-01-19T08:00:49+00:00", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.4", "Id": "28", "UID": 20028, "OID": 20028.0, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": "6,265,3", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "120244", "Bowler_Name": "Selena Ross", "Batsman": "108890", "Batsman_Name": "Kamalini G", "Batsman_Style": "L", "Commentary": "Fuller, on off, Kamalini G\u00a0whacks it uppishly towards the bowler. Ross sticks out her right hand but the ball has been hit hard and it clips the fingertips before rolling behind.", "Timestamp": "2025-01-19T08:00:27+00:00", "Non_Striker": "83638", "Non_Striker_Name": "Sanika Chalke", "Score": "33/1", "Batsman_Runs": "1", "Bowler_Conceded_Runs": "1", "Ball_Speed": "", "Ball_Number": "22", "Over_No": "4", "Ball": "4", "Ball_Line_Length": "23,3,27,8", "This_Over": "0,1,0,1,", "Batsman_Details": {"Batsman": "108890", "Runs": "8", "Balls": "11", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}, "Non_Striker_Details": {"Batsman": "83638", "Runs": "12", "Balls": "9", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}, "Bowler_Details": {"Bowler": "120244", "Overs": "1.4", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "11", "Wickets": "0"}, "Milestone": [], "Edited_Commentary": 1, "Default_Commentary": "3.4: Selena Ross to Kamalini G, 1 run, played towards mid off.", "Created_Timestamp": "2025-01-19T08:00:21+00:00", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.3", "Id": "27", "UID": 20027, "OID": 20027.0, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": "", "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "120244", "Bowler_Name": "Selena Ross", "Batsman": "108890", "Batsman_Name": "Kamalini G", "Batsman_Style": "L", "Commentary": "Run out chance missed! Length delivery, on off, Kamalini G\u00a0skips down the track and lofts it on the bounce\u00a0towards mid off. Both batters set off for the run but seeing Jahzara Claxton\u00a0get across to her left, Kamalini turns her back on her partner. Claxton's momentum is taking her to her left. Ends up throwing it a bit wayward to the right of the b